#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:5
msgid "Split cells"
msgstr "拆分单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ allows splitting `cells`_ previously "
"`merged`_ from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_ and using the corresponding keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 允许通过 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 、`工具栏 "
"<toolbar_>`_ 以及相应的键盘快捷键拆分先前 `已合并 <merged_>`_ 的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:11
msgid "Split cells from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏拆分单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:13
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:24
#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:38
msgid "Select the merged `cells`_ which should be split."
msgstr "选择要拆分的已合并 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Split cells** menu item to split the selected `cells`_."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 拆分单元格** 菜单项以拆分选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:19
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:22
msgid "Split cells from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏拆分单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:25
msgid ""
"Select the icon |icon_split| from the `toolbar`_ to split the selected "
"`cells`_."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |icon_split| 以拆分选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:31
msgid "icon_split"
msgstr "拆分图标"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:29
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Edit**"
msgstr "如果未显示 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ ，可通过 **设置 > 显示 > 编辑** 将其显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:34
msgid "Split cells using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键拆分单元格"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:36
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:39
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + k`` to split the selected `cells`_."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + k`` 可拆分选定的 `单元格 <cells_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/cells_split.rst:43
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "有关 QElectroTech 键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参阅 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
